  <Cheat Text="Infinite Health (TR I-III)" Description="Restores Lara to 1,000 health during the health-display update in both rendering paths. Instant-death traps may still kill her. Experimental PS5 adaptation for PPSA16901 01.001.000 on firmware 11.60. Effect confirmed by the owner in TR2 only; TR1 and TR3 pending. by douityourself; original PS4 code: hejran7.">
